### Description

When an `InvalidPromptError` (or any other early error) occurs during streamText execution, the exception is not propagated to the response promise, causing the promise to remain unsettled and bypassing the catch block. This leads to an "unsettled top-level await" warning and unexpected behavior.

Code to reproduce:

```typescript
import { createGoogleGenerativeAI } from "@ai-sdk/google";
import { streamText } from "ai";

const google = createGoogleGenerativeAI({});

async function test() {
  try {
    const result = streamText({ model: google("") });
    for await (const message of result.toUIMessageStream()) {
      console.log(message);
    }
    console.log(await result.response); // <-- NEVER PRINTS
  } catch (e) {
    console.log("caught ", e); // <-- NEVER EXECUTES
  }
}

await test()
```

This results in:

```
{ type: 'start' }
InvalidPromptError [AI_InvalidPromptError]: Invalid prompt: prompt or messages must be defined
    at standardizePrompt (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/prompt/standardize-prompt.ts:23:11)
    at streamStep (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/generate-text/stream-text.ts:1007:39)
    at fn (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/generate-text/stream-text.ts:1466:15)
    at <anonymous> (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/telemetry/record-span.ts:18:28)
    at Object.startActiveSpan (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/telemetry/noop-tracer.ts:21:14)
    at recordSpan (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/telemetry/record-span.ts:16:17)
    at new DefaultStreamTextResult (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/generate-text/stream-text.ts:976:5)
    at streamText (/Users/xxx/src/node_modules/ai/src/generate-text/stream-text.ts:398:10)
    at test (/Users/xxx/src/testerror.ts:8:20)
    at <anonymous> (/Users/xxx/src/testerror.ts:18:7) {
  cause: undefined,
  prompt: { system: undefined, prompt: undefined, messages: undefined },
  [Symbol(vercel.ai.error)]: true,
  [Symbol(vercel.ai.error.AI_InvalidPromptError)]: true
}
{
  type: 'error',
  errorText: 'Invalid prompt: prompt or messages must be defined'
}
Warning: Detected unsettled top-level await at /Users/xxx/src/testerror.ts:18
await test()
^
```

* The result.response promise does not resolve or reject.
* The catch block is not executed, and no exception is logged.
* An "unsettled top-level await" warning is emitted.

Expected behaviour:

* The InvalidPromptError should be propagated to the result.response promise.
* The catch block should execute, logging the error

### AI SDK Version

- ai: 5.0.5
- @ai-sdk/google: 2.0.2
